%%% note
mulet samples/objectstore-test。ObjectStore コネクタ: store / retrieve (値の mime が保たれるか) /
retrieve の default-value / 無いキーの retrieve (OS:KEY_NOT_FOUND が既定のエラー応答に
どう出るか) / contains / remove (無いキーの remove) / retrieve-all / retrieve-all-keys / clear、
key が null のとき (OS:INVALID_KEY?)。retrieve-all の順序は実装依存なので、キー 1 つで見る。
%%% port 18105
%%% mask
\$ByteBuddy\$withAnnotations@([0-9a-f]+)
%%% request POST /os/clear
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "status": "cleared"
}
%%% request POST /os/store?key=k1
Content-Type: application/json

{"v": 1, "s": "one"}
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "status": "stored",
  "key": "k1"
}
%%% request GET /os/retrieve?key=k1
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "v": 1,
  "s": "one"
}
%%% request GET /os/contains?key=k1
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "key": "k1",
  "exists": true
}
%%% request GET /os/contains?key=nope
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "key": "nope",
  "exists": false
}
%%% request GET /os/retrieve?key=nope
%%% response 500
content-type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8

ObjectStore 'org.mule.extension.objectstore.api.TopLevelObjectStore$ByteBuddy$withAnnotations@***; location: testStore' doesn't contain any value for key 'nope' and default value was not provided or resolved to a null value.
%%% request GET /os/retrieve/default?key=nope
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

"default-value"
%%% request GET /os/retrieve/default?key=k1
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "v": 1,
  "s": "one"
}
%%% request GET /os/retrieve-all
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "k1": "{\"v\": 1, \"s\": \"one\"}"
}
%%% request GET /os/retrieve-all-keys
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

[
  "k1"
]
%%% request POST /os/store?key=k1
Content-Type: text/plain

overwritten
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "status": "stored",
  "key": "k1"
}
%%% request GET /os/retrieve?key=k1
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

"overwritten"
%%% request DELETE /os/remove?key=k1
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "status": "removed"
}
%%% request DELETE /os/remove?key=k1
%%% response 500
content-type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8

ObjectStore doesn't contain any value for key 'k1'
%%% request GET /os/retrieve-all
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  
}
%%% request POST /os/store
Content-Type: text/plain

no key
%%% response 500
content-type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8

Required parameter 'key' was assigned with value '#[attributes.queryParams.key]' which resolved to null. Required parameters need to be assigned with non null values
%%% request POST /os/store?key=k2
Content-Type: text/plain

two
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "status": "stored",
  "key": "k2"
}
%%% request POST /os/clear
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "status": "cleared"
}
%%% request GET /os/retrieve-all-keys
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

[
  
]
